+This helper belongs INSIDE the existing finite trusted service process. It does
+not start a service, renew its clock, retry, or infer cessation from task.cancel.
+Bubblewrap/user namespaces/pidfds are required, never assumed. Missing primitives
+are admission failures, never a downgrade to AgentContext.reset/process census.
