+    create this object around a concrete native job boundary. A restarted host
+    gets the existing original boundary's stop-only path, without keys or a
+    reusable object. The ordinary A0Adapter continues its cold exact-stop path.
+
+    journal is the existing host store's fail-closed service/job journal; native
