+class A0FiniteWarmJournal:
+    """Bounded service/job evidence in the existing PluginState and flock.
+
+    The original Associations row remains the sole native custody/capacity
+    owner until real cessation. Settling a child job never sets quiescence on
+    that row. These records have no restart/adoption/secret recovery authority.
+    """
